<title>FINLAND: Metra Jan-Apr profit falls to FIM 38 mln.</title>
<headline>Metra Jan-Apr profit falls to FIM 38 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after financial items		    38 vs 50</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.42 vs 0.37</p>
<p> Net sales					  3,985 vs 3,162</p>
<p> Operating profit				   113 vs 113</p>
<p>NOTE - The median of 13 analysts' forecasts for Finnish diversified engineering group Metra Oy's profit after financial items had been 83 million markka in a 36-180 million range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 190 vs 150</p>
<p> Share in results of associated firms charge 15 vs 6 charge</p>
<p> Net financial items			charge 75 vs 63 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 10 vs nil</p>
<p> Minorities				     gain 33 vs 7 gain</p>
<p> Taxes						   55 vs 39</p>
<p> Net profit					    26 vs 18</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    31.9 vs 31.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Metra Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 9 680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
